{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AcroChallenge is a simple, yet fun and creative word game where you compete against others to make the\u00a0best phrase that fits a 3 to 7 letter acronym (ie. &quot;ABCG&quot;) generated by the server.\u00a0 Race against the clock to create the best phrase (ie. &quot;Already Been Chewed Gum&quot;).\u00a0 Impress  your friends with your wit and intellect, or just entertain them with stupid and funny phrases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how to play - against bots, with Stream friends or make new friends.\u00a0 If you want simple - one click will get you into a random game.\u00a0 Or you can create your own game - play against just bots or with only Steam friends (coming soon).\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it more challenging by including per-round 'Topics' that can be set by the server, game winner, or game creator.\u00a0 Once in a game you can chat with other players as well.\u00a0 But don't worry, you can 'mute' them if you don't like what they have to say.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717250?t=1750344198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717250/0265004b2198763da0df1da89bd6d1ee925a7976/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750344198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717250/a97a86447d6083b2d5ac82f4068b86eeeddb69a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750344198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717250/a97a86447d6083b2d5ac82f4068b86eeeddb69a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750344198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AcroChallenge is a simple, yet fun and creative word game where you compete against others to make the\u00a0best phrase that fits a 3 to 7 letter acronym (ie. &quot;ABCG&quot;) generated by the server.\u00a0 Race against the clock to create the best phrase (ie. &quot;Already Been Chewed Gum&quot;).\u00a0 Impress  your friends with your wit and intellect, or just entertain them with stupid and funny phrases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how to play - against bots, with Stream friends or make new friends.\u00a0 If you want simple - one click will get you into a random game.\u00a0 Or you can create your own game - play against just bots or with only Steam friends (coming soon).\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it more challenging by including per-round 'Topics' that can be set by the server, game winner, or game creator.\u00a0 Once in a game you can chat with other players as well.\u00a0 But don't worry, you can 'mute' them if you don't like what they have to say.</p>","developers":["Bingers, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717250/72aa0260432df6161239ad995aa20051b0c6a32a/header.jpg?t=1750344198","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3717250/1935466697/f23905a3cf0d8d1475af6f690cdf762143f56104/1750391163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747955479","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3717250/1935466697/f23905a3cf0d8d1475af6f690cdf762143f56104/1750391163/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747955479","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3717250/1935466697/f23905a3cf0d8d1475af6f690cdf762143f56104/1750391163/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747955479","id":257143824,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","th